        "Title": "Welcome Back, Agent17 №6",
        "Location": "LOCATION_PARIS",
        "PublicId": "102681894686",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Paris/_scene_paris.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 335ce4e7-36bb-45cd-aa24-18564d48ed4e).Image",
        "Description": "After your contract in Mumbai, influential people from Saudi Arabia became interested in you. They want you to eliminate several members of the Al‑Ghazali family, offering a huge sum of money in return. Complete a series of these contracts, and then we’ll move on to the next ones. Right now, you’re heading to Paris for the “Sangvin” fashion show. Among the VIP guests will be Sheikh Salman Al‑Ghazali; eliminate him first, and then his security detail, after which I’ll send you to Dubai. Work, 17!",
